        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_15"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE PETROLEUM (INCOME TAX) ACT 1967 Commencement of amendments to the Petroleum (Income Tax)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 12,13,14and 15 shall have effect for year of assessment 2002 and subsequent years of assessment. Amendment of section 16"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967, which in this Chapter is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended in section 16 by inserting after subsection (7c) the following subsection: \"(7H) There shall be deducted from the relevant gross income an amount equal to the expenditure incurred by a person in the relevant period on the provision of practical training in Malaysia, in relation to his business, to an individual who is— (a) resident in the basis year for a year of assessment; and (b) not an employee of that person.\". Amendment of section 18"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_13__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_13__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 18 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_13__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting paragraph (1)(7); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_13__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (l)(m) the following paragraph: \"(m) any sum paid by way of rentals in respect of a motor vehicle, other than a motor vehicle licensed by the appropriate authority for commercial transportation of goods or passengers, in excess of fifty thousand ringgit: Provided that if the motor vehicle has not been used by any person for any purpose prior to the rental and the total cost of the motor vehicle does not exceed one hundred and fifty thousand ringgit, any sum paid by way of rental in excess of one hundred thousand ringgit: Provided further that the maximum amount of deduction in respect of the rentals of such motor vehicle in the year of assessment and subsequent years of assessment shall not in the aggregate exceed fifty thousand ringgit or one hundred thousand ringgit, as the case may be, in respect of that motor vehicle.\". Amendment of Second Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_g"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Second Schedule to the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 3, by substituting for the word \"4\" the word \"3A\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph 3 the following paragraph: \"3A. (1) Subject to subparagraph (2), where a building is purchased for use as an industrial building from a person who constructed that building and that building has not been used by any person for any purpose prior to the purchase, then, for the purposes of this Schedule— (a) the purchaser shall be deemed to have constructed that building and deemed to have incurred capital expenditure on the construction of that building; (b) the purchase price shall be deemed to be the capital expenditure incurred on the construction of that building; and (c) the date of that purchase shall be deemed to be the date of the construction of that building. (2) The capital expenditure incurred by the person who constructed the building and the date of construction of that building by that person to which regard would be had but for this subparagraph shall be disregarded for the purposes of this Schedule.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 9, by inserting after the word \"construction\" the words \"or purchase\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 11, by substituting for the words \"to 14\" the words \"and 13\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_e__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_e__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 13 —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_e__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_e",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the word \"construction\" the words \"or purchase\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_e__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_e",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the word \"two\" the word \"three\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting paragraph 14; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 15, by deleting the words \"or 14\". Special provision relating to paragraph 13 of Second Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the provision of paragraph 13 of the Second Schedule to the principal Act, where an annual allowance has been made to a person in respect of a purchased building, and that allowance has been calculated based on a permitted fraction under paragraph 14 of the Second Schedule to the principal Act before coming into operation of the deletion of that paragraph under paragraph I 4( f) of this Act, which is higher than three per cent, the annual allowance for a year of assessment for that building shall be calculated based on the higher fraction and that allowance shall not exceed the amount of the residual expenditure at the end of the basis period for that year of assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule 7A to the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 1, by substituting for the word \"Where\" the words \"Subject to this Schedule, where\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 1A, by substituting for the word \"Where\" the words \"Subject to this Schedule, where\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph 1A the following paragraph: \"1B. (1) Subject to subparagraph (2), where a company (in this paragraph referred to as \"the acquirer\") has incurred capital expenditure in respect of an asset for the purposes of a qualifying project and that asset is acquired from another company (in this paragraph referred to as \"the disposer\") and at the time of the acquisition— (a) the acquirer of the asset is a person over whom the disposer of the asset has control; (b) the disposer of the asset is a person over whom the acquirer of the asset has control; (c) some other person has control over the acquirer and disposer of the asset; or (d) the acquisition is effected in consequence of a scheme of reconstruction or amalgamation of companies, the acquirer shall be deemed to have incurred that capital expenditure on the asset on the first day of the disposer's final period, of an amount equal to the amount of residual expenditure ascertained under sub- paragraph (3). (2) Where the disposer incurred capital expenditure in relation to the asset referred to in subparagraph (1) on or after the first day of the disposer's final period, the acquirer shall be deemed to have incurred capital expenditure on the asset on the day that disposer incurred capital expenditure, of an amount equal to the amount of capital expenditure incurred by that disposer. (3) For the purposes of subparagraph (1), residual expenditure in relation to an asset shall be the capital expenditure incurred by the disposer reduced by the amount of allowances on that asset under Schedule 3 that has been made or would have been made to the disposer in the basis period or periods before the first day of the disposer's final period. (4) In this paragraph — \"asset\" means a factory, plant or machinery referred to in paragraph 1, or plant, machinery or building referred to in the definition of \"capital expenditure\" in paragraph 9; \"control\", in relation to a company, means the power of a person to secure, by means of the holding of shares or the possession of voting power in or in relation to that or any other company, or by virtue of any powers conferred by the articles of association or other document regulating that or any other company, that the affairs of the first-mentioned company are conducted in accordance with the wishes of that person; \"the disposer's final period\", in relation to the disposal and acquisition of an asset, means the basis period (appropriate to the disposer's business for the purposes of which expenditure has been incurred in relation to the asset) for the year of assessment which coincides with the first year of assessment for which an allowance under Schedule 3 may be made to the acquirer in relation to the asset if it is used for the purposes of a business carried on by the acquirer or as an industrial building.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 2, by substituting for the word \"five\" the word \"fifteen\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
