      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_g__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_g",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the word \"one-fiftieth\" the word \"three-hundredth\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_h",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "h",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting paragraph 17;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_i",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 18, by substituting for the words \"15, 16 or 17\" the words \"15 or 16\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_j",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "j",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 37'c, by substituting for the words \"12, 16 or 17\" the words \"12 or 16\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_k",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "k",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph 37E the following paragraphs: \"Qualifying expenditure: Building used for hotel 37F. The provisions of this Schedule relating to industrial buildings shall apply, mutatis mutandis, to a building or part thereof used by a person solely for the purpose of an hotel and that hotel is registered with the Ministry of Culture, Arts and Tourism. Qualifying expenditure: Airport 31 G. The provisions of this Schedule relating to industrial buildings shall apply, mutatis mutandis, to an airport and the reference to capital expenditure incurred in relation to that airport shall include the capital expenditure on the construction, reconstruction, extension, improvement or purchase of any building, runway or ancillary structures. Qualifying expenditure: Motor racing circuit 37H. The provisions of this Schedule relating to industrial buildings shall apply, mutatis mutandis, to a motor racing circuit approved by the Minister and the reference to capital expenditure incurred in relation to that motor racing circuit shall include the capital expenditure on the construction, reconstruction, extension or improvement of that motor racing circuit or ancillary structures.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_l",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "l",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraphs 42A, 42B and 42c, by deleting the words \", 17\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_m",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "m",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subparagraph 65(3), by deleting the words \", hotel\". Special provision relating to paragraph 16 of Schedule 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the provisions of paragraph 16 of Schedule 3 to the principal Act, where an annual allowance has been made to a person in respect of a purchased building, and that allowance has been calculated based on a permitted fraction under paragraph 17 of Schedule 3 to the principal Act before the coming into operation of the deletion of that paragraph under paragraph 8( h) of this Act, which is higher than three-hundredth, the annual allowance for a year of assessment for that building shall be calculated based on the higher fraction and that allowance shall not exceed the amount of the residual expenditure at the end of the basis period for that year of assessment. Amendment of Schedule 7 A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "IV",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_16",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_17",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_19",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_21"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE STAMP ACT 1949 Commencement of amendments to the Stamp Act 1949"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 17, 18, 19, 20 and 21 shall have effect from 1 January 2002. Amendment of section 9"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Stamp Act 1949, which in this Chapter is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended in subsection 9(3), by substituting for the words \"Minister of Finance\" the word \"Collector\". New section 38A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_8"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 38 the following section: 38A. (1) Any person who is dissatisfied with an assessment of the Collector under section 36 may, by written notice (referred to in this Act as \"notice of objection\"), object to the assessment and apply to the Collector to review the assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every notice of objection shall state the grounds of objection to the Collector's assessment and shall be made within thirty days after the date of the assessment or such further period as the Collector may allow in any particular case."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The person giving a notice of objection shall furnish further particulars and information in relation to the grounds of the objection if required to do so by the Collector in writing."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Collector shall, on receipt of a notice of objection and such further particulars and information as he may require under subsection (3), review the assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "After the objection has been determined, the Collector shall notify the person in writing of his decision."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where, on review, it appears to the Collector that the amount of duty originally assessed is excessive, he may cancel the original assessment and make such other assessment in substitution of the original assessment and shall serve on the person a notice of substituted assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The making of an objection shall not relieve the person of liability to pay the duty as required by this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any reference in this Act to an assessment shall be construed as including a reference to a substituted assessment under subsection (6).\". Amendment of section 39"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_19__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_19__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 39 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_19__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1) Any person who is dissatisfied with the decision of the Collector under section 38A(5) may, within twenty- one days after the person is notified in writing of that decision and upon payment of duty in conformity therewith, appeal against the decision to the High Court by filing a notice of appeal with the High Court and may for that purpose require the Collector to state and sign a case, setting forth the question upon which his opinion was required, and the decision made by him.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_19__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1A) Where a notice of appeal has been filed under subsection (1), the notice shall be served on the Collector within the time stipulated for the filing of the notice of appeal.\". Amendment of section 47A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 47 A of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2) The Collector may, if he thinks fit, reduce or remit such penalty or the further amount payable under section 9(l)(c).\". Amendment of First Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_21__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_21__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The First Schedule to the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_21__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 27(d), by substituting for the words \"borrowing company in Malaysia approved by the Minister of Finance\" the words \"finance company licensed under the Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989 or under the Islamic Banking Act 1983 or a scheduled institution as defined under section 2 of the Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_21__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph 32(c), by substituting for the words \"borrowing company in Malaysia approved by the Minister of Finance\" the words \"finance company licensed under the Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989 or under the Islamic Banking Act 1983 or a scheduled institution as defined under section 2 of the Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Finance Act 2001. Amendments of Acts"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/39/eng@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 [Act 543] and the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378] are amended in the manner specified in Chapters II, III and IV respectively."
      }
    }
  ]
}
